book battle lost souls~
The Battle of Lost Souls was a great war fought between the armies of Gil-
Glash and Lothar, who were both extremely powerful warriors in their time.
History has long since forgotten why the battle began, but folklore tells of
how Lothar finalls grew tired of Gil-Glash's reign of tyranny. Rumor has it,
however, that the great battle rages on even in death, the mighty armies
unaware of their fate...
~
